Output target/readme-demo/discuss.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1512
Set Height 768
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set LineHeight 1.18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set Padding 22
Set Margin 18
Set MarginFill "#11121b"
Set BorderRadius 8
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Hide
Type "python3 docs/demo/seed.py review"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "nn"
Sleep 600ms
Show
Sleep 2.3s
Type "c"
Sleep 400ms
Type "Can we test reconnecting after an offline read?"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Screenshot target/readme-demo/hero-source.png
Sleep 400ms
